# The build context is ./backend/typst. Only the Dockerfile is needed to build the
# image, so everything else is excluded: the vendored payloads are ~57 MB of binaries
# that arrive as read-only bind mounts at runtime (policy 4.5), not as image content.
#
# NOTE: these are the VENDORED PAYLOADS and the spike harness, not the tracked
# fixture sources. `fixtures/` is deliberately excluded too: the fixtures are
# staged into /work at RUN time by the broker, never baked into the image, so that a
# compile can only ever see files the stager put there this job.
toolchain/
fonts/
packages/
fixtures/
spike/
*.md
!Dockerfile
